# No Empty Directories
RULE: Core package paths must not have empty dirs (only __pycache__/.DS_Store). Quality gates fail if found.
WHY: Indicates deleted code not cleaned up; confuses developers.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md, quality-gates-service-template.sh
DO: Remove empty dirs; add .gitkeep if intentionally empty for structure
NEVER: Leave empty service/package dirs; ignore in quality gates
